his laundry\nShasta Geaux Pop thrusts exponentially\nRonald Peet navigates the fog\nDeepali Gupta conducts murmurations\nEveryone\u2019s favorite animatronics: The Lame Drivers\nSean Spada takes it slow\nApple Pie Bundy has some special friends he\u2019d like you to meet\n\n** For a limited time, guests may experience special performances by live actors **\n\n*For everyone\u2019s safety, the staff of the Under wants to discourage guests from using ritual magic to enlarge the crobs.*", "short_description": "The newest game from the creators of \u201cVirtual Virtual Reality:\u201d a time and mind bending theatrical adventure -  complete with ghost puzzles, jazzercise and dolphins."}]}, "developer_name": "Tender Claws", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://tenderclaws.com/privacy/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://tenderclaws.com/privacy/EULA.html", "publisher_name": "Tender Claws", "support_website_url": "https://tenderclaws.com/about", "website_url": "https://tenderclaws.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1008279844328894"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "NARRATIVE", "EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "998404040762632"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "270088040754591"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "666904643892590"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "725378238277947"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1160